### Variables
@apiKey = your-api-key-here
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@aiSearchEndpoint = https://your-aisearch-resource.search.windows.net/indexes/your-index-name/docs/search?api-version=2025-08-01-preview
@aiSearchApiKey = your-aisearch-api-key-here
@aiSearchVectorFields = vector1,vector2

### Health Check
# Note: No authentication required for health checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Query AI Search - Basic Hybrid Query (Single Search Term)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "What is the subject and guidance in BSP Memorandum M-2024-017?"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Multiple Search Queries
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "How do I configure Cosmos DB for vector search?",
    "How do I configure Cosmos DB?",
    "configure Cosmos DB for vector search"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Complex Multi-Query Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=5&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "Azure Functions deployment best practices",
    "How to deploy Azure Functions?",
    "Azure Functions configuration guide",
    "Optimize Azure Functions performance",
    "Azure Functions security recommendations"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Single Vector Field
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields=vector1
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "SharePoint integration with Azure"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Three Vector Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=15&vector_fields=vector1,vector2,vector3
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "AI model integration patterns",
    "Machine learning deployment strategies"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Custom Top Value (20 results)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=20&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "Database migration strategies",
    "Cloud migration best practices"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Small Top Value (3 results)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=3&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "Azure Monitor setup",
    "Application Insights configuration"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Long Query Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "I need detailed information about implementing a comprehensive security strategy for Azure cloud infrastructure including identity management, network security, data encryption at rest and in transit, key vault integration, and compliance monitoring across multiple regions and subscriptions"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Multiple Queries with Semantic Variations
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "search": [
    "What are the best practices for Azure Functions?",
    "Azure Functions best practices",
    "How to optimize Azure Functions?",
    "Azure Functions optimization guide",
    "Improve Azure Functions performance"
  ]
}

### Query AI Search - Technical Documentation Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/query_aisearch?search_endpoint={{aiSearchEndpoint}}&search_api_key={{aiSearchApiKey}}&top=10&vector_fields={{aiSearchVectorFields}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

