### Sig Compare - Basic Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/sig_compare?forward_endpoint=https://your-target-endpoint.com/api/compare
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="valid_id"; filename="valid_id1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./testdata/valid-id/testing/valid_id1.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specimen_signatures"; filename="specimen1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./testdata/specimen/testing/specimen1.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

